`wait` (manager.rs:589-612) loops on `updates.recv().await` until the record reaches a terminal status — no deadline. Non-cancellable repo-scoped jobs exist and run arbitrary user commands: `crates/fleet-daemon/src/services/worktrees/post_create.rs:42` submits `JobKind::PostCreateHooks` with `JobPolicy::new(false, true)`, and `post_create.rs:214` and `services/worktrees/trash.rs:144` use `JobPolicy::new(false, false)`. The caller is `delete_repo_cascade`, which takes the tombstone first: `let _deleting = self.jobs.begin_repo_deletion(&repo)?; self.jobs.quiesce_repo(&repo).await?;` (services/dispatch.rs:690-691).

